configs/grid_search/

# Reference paper PDFs — local-only (copyrighted + binary; keep repo lean).
# Cite papers via Logs/references/README.md + references.bib instead.
Logs/references/pdfs/*
!Logs/references/pdfs/.gitkeep

# Cloned upstream baseline code — installed by external/setup_*.sh, NOT vendored
# (e.g. external/gflownet for FragGFN). Keeps the setup scripts tracked, the heavy
# upstream trees out. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md + validation/generators/README.md.
#
# Ignore EVERYTHING here except the setup scripts. The previous rule was `external/*/`,
# which matches directories only — so when a git worktree linked the clones in
# (experiments/lsd_hubs/matrix16/link_worktree_data.sh), the resulting SYMLINKS did not match,
# got committed, and on merge replaced the real clones in the main checkout with links pointing
# at themselves. Path-shaped, not type-shaped, so a symlink can never slip through again.
external/*
!external/setup_*.sh

